        "ggNDidup3R8_label": "<p>Unlock Your Potential</p>",
        "ggltWT4Vmhc_text": "<p>90 Day Money Back Guarantee</p>",
        "gg9pdUoCj9H_text": "Reignite Your Primal Drive*",
        "ggAkYPu4R1y_text": "<p>Low testosterone leads to fatigue, sluggish motivation, and decreased performance. Our clinically studied formula combines Tongkat Ali, Fenugreek, and Himalayan Shilajit, shown to increase free testosterone by 20% in 3 months and improve libido, endurance, and vitality</p>",
        "gg_wahbrhRP_text": "Conquer Stress &amp; Fatigue*",
        "ggJOaatLhVA_text": "<p>Feel the difference in your mind as well as your body. Red Panax Ginseng and Ashwagandha have been shown in 10,000+ studies to reduce cortisol levels by 32%, enhancing mental sharpness, stress resilience, and cognitive endurance. No more mfog – just razor-sharp focus and confidence all day long.</p>",
