        "gguxTbtX48d_text": "<p>No synthetic stimulants, no jitters – just real, lasting energy. L-Citrulline and Tribulus Terrestris work to improve blood flow by 38%, accelerating muscle recovery, improving endurance, and enhancing athletic performance.&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggPhTLuWhGD_text": "Fortify Your Foundation*",
        "ggw6ao5sPK0_text": "<p>This formula isn't just about strength – it cares about your inner well-being too. It includes Shilajit, a superfood that fortifies your gut and immune system with valuable nutrients, promoting overall health and recovery for peak performance.*</p>",
        "ggmJPZ8Jgnv_text": "Maximize Nutrient Absorption for Faster Results*",
        "gg4P5dP1yGB_text": "<p>Not all supplements are created equal. Our formula includes BioPerine®, which has been clinically shown to increase nutrient absorption by 30%, ensuring every dose delivers maximum impact . No wasted ingredients—just fast, effective an feel.</p>",
        "ggMqmIjkJ7N_text": "The Alpha's Edge*",
        "ggvs-_dvVTi_text": "<p>We don't just make claims – we back them with science. Our formula is built on a foundation of research, combining powerful, scientifically studied ingredients to create a comprehensive solution. Don't settle for mediocrity - achieve transformative results with the science-driven power of this formula!*</p>"
      }
    },
