        "ggEYQskdnAe_customText": "Ships by",
        "gg3Hdn30x9y_text": "<p><strong>86 orders</strong> with gift remaining</p>",
        "ggT9tpprtrU_childItem_0": "<p><strong>Ingredients</strong></p>",
        "ggT9tpprtrU_childItem_1": "<p><strong>Why choose Shilajit Alpha King</strong></p>",
        "ggT9tpprtrU_childItem_2": "<p><strong>Shipping policy</strong></p>",
        "ggT9tpprtrU_childItem_3": "<p><strong>Return policy</strong></p>",
        "ggMP1_Cch_M_text": "<ul><li><strong>Himalayan Shilajit (Asphaltum) Extract 20:1 (&gt;70% Fulvic Acid):</strong> Known as the \"destroyer of weakness,\" this powerful adaptogen supports energy levels, endurance, and overall vitality.</li><li><strong>Tongkat Ali (Eurycoma Longifolia) 200:1 (standardized to 1% Eurycomanone):</strong> This legendary herb is renowned for boosting testosterone levels, enhancing libido, and improving physical performance.</li><li><strong>Ashwagandha (Withania Somnifera) Root Extract 10:1 (KSM-66) (standardized to 5% Withanolides):</strong> A premier adaptogen, Ashwagandha reduces stress, enhances mood, and supports muscle strength and recovery.</li><li><strong>Fenugreek (Trigonella Foenum-Graecum) Seed Extract 10:1 (50% Saponin):</strong> This powerful extract helps maintain healthy testosterone levels, supports muscle growth, and enhances libido.</li><li><strong>Red Panax Ginseng Extract 10:1 (Standardized to 10% Ginsenoside):</strong> An ancient root known for its ability to boost energy, improve cognitive function, and support immune health.</li><li><strong>Tribulus (Tribulus Terrestris L.) Whole Herb Extract (45% Saponins):</strong> Traditionally used to enhance athletic performance, support testosterone production, and improve overall vitality.</li><li><strong>Boron (as Boron Citrate):</strong> This essential mineral supports bone health, improves cognitive function, and plays a crucial role in hormone regulation.</li><li><strong>Magnesium (as Magnesium Bisglycinate):</strong> Vital for muscle function, energy production, and maintaining healthy nerve function.</li><li><strong>L-Citrulline:</strong> A powerful amino acid that enhances blood flow, reduces muscle fatigue, and supports cardiovascular health.</li></ul>",
