        "ggepByyPiND_text": "<p>I’m a 42-year-old dad who works a desk job, and I was tired of feeling sluggish and… soft, to be honest. After a few weeks on Alpha King, I’m starting to feel like myself again—actually, better than I have in years. My workouts have been more intense, I’ve lost some belly fat, and my confidence is way up. The best part? It feels natural, not like I’m on some sketchy supplement. Highly recommend it if you’re feeling stuck or low on energy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
